  displayName: Correlation vs. Causat
  type: TwistedEvidence
  text: My friend went gluten-free and her acne cleared up...
  debunkingText: ' This confuses Correlation with Causation. Just because B happened
    after A doesn''t mean A caused B. Maybe she also cut out sugar, or simply got
    older.'
